  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 502.57 State revolving fund (SRF) attorney",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 502.57 “State revolving fund (SRF) attorney” means the attorney(s) under contract to the department for the purpose of providing:\n\n(a) Legal review of initial loan documents and allonges; and\n\n(b) Other legal services associated with providing financial assistance to non-governmental entities.\n\nSource. #13511, eff 12-20-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq500.html"
